# What the Docker build does not send to the daemon.
#
# The build context is this directory, so the patterns here are relative to
# it. This file is named `Dockerfile.dockerignore`, which is the name the
# builder looks for when the ignore file is not in the context root; it is
# kept beside the Dockerfile so that the two stay together.
#
# Docker 构建不发给守护进程的内容。
#
# 构建上下文就是本目录，因此这里的模式相对于它。本文件名为
# `Dockerfile.dockerignore`，当忽略文件不在上下文根时构建器就找这个名字；它与
# Dockerfile 放在一起，使两者不致分离。

# Build output. Both are produced inside the image, and a copy from the host
# would be used in place of the newly built one, which is the sort of mistake
# that produces an image of an older revision.
#
# 构建产物。两者都在镜像内产生，而从宿主机复制来的副本会被用来代替新构建的那个
# ——这正是会产出旧版本镜像的那类失误。
**/target
frontend/dist

# Dependencies, which the frontend stage installs from the lock file.
#
# 依赖，由前端阶段依据 lock 文件安装。
**/node_modules

# Version control, which the build does not read.
#
# 版本控制，构建不会读取。
**/.git

# Working notes dropped beside the project, such as screenshots of a page
# under inspection.
#
# 丢在项目旁边的临时笔记，例如正在检查的页面截图。
tmp
